sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant-Diwakar be released on bail in Case Crime No.37 of 2023, under Sections 420,
406, 467, 471, 468 and 120-B I.P.C., registered at Police Station Naka Hindola, District Lucknow on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

